Dear players! We are happy to congratulate you on the New Year!
We have prepared for you a global update:

What's new? This time, to a greater extent, changes touched the car's motoring part 😉
Namely:
- Added the ability to add items to the trunk of the car;
- Added the ability to install additional modules into the car (just put them there, into the trunk - and they will start working);
- To start the car you also need to use a battery;
- Added several additional modules (fun and not very) for cars that you can also use (find yourself! ;-));
- Improved visual effects from the headlights of cars, increased the distance of lighting car headlights;
- Added a new car - NIVA 4x4 (with steep additional lights on the roof, when installing twists with armor);

Besides:
- Added arena to the bar! Now you can call players to a duel (key F);
- The life of objects is increased 3 times (all except those that are generated on spawns);
- increased the total number of items on the locations, now the "loot" will be larger);
- premium is not taken away in the arena (it is necessary to test);
- The bar is more normal world, as well as in the corridors of the arena;
- The mechanics of the peace zone is completely controlled on the server (the mechanism is modified), - maybe in the future there will even be dynamic peace zones (added / removed by administrators right during the game, etc.)

New Year:
- Traditionally, snow is added to the location of the Neighborhood;
- Added a peace zone in the DC, a tape recorder with music, a Christmas tree, feuerwigs in different parts of the location;
- Chupacabra suddenly changed shape! 😉 Yes, yes, it's the one that eats players, and not just stands at the DK. 😉
- Sometimes admins will give out gifts to players; Do not try to kill them !; To get a gift, you have to tell the poem in the voice);

HAPPY NEW YEAR! 😉 HOPE YOU WILL UPDATE! 😉

