Update downloaded:
- Fixed a bug with the loss of ammunition from the cage when the weapon is removed from the equipment slot.  Now the ammunition appears in the inventory and after the equipment the weapon needs to be recharged again;
- Fixed a bug with the ability to buy equipment from the Shtopor and go into negative.
